              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Gus 4:42",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uku ni ko bikwiye kugenda ku vy’umukoracumu azohungirayo, ngw abone gukira: ūzokwica umuntu atabigize ibigirankana, atar’ asanzwe amwanka; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nk’iy’ umuntu ajanye na mugenzi we mu kibira kwicira ibiti, akihanukīra n’incabiti guca igiti, incabiti ikaroka, ikamījūkira kuri mugenzi we, ikamwica; ben’ uyo az’ ahungire mu gisagara kimwe mur’ ivyo, abone gukira; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bibe birtyo kugira ng’ umuhōzi amukurikiye ntaz’ amuhamvye mu nzira akiratse, bitewe n’uko habaye kure, akamwica; kand’ atar’ akwiye gupfa, kukw atar’ asanzwe amwanka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni co gitumye mbagera, ngo mwirobanurire ibisagara bitatu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.19.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
