        },
        {
          "text": "Ni mwamara kwegukira amashamvu mu gihugu Uhoraho Imana yanyu abahaye ngo mucinjire, ntihaze hagire ūshingūra akarimbi k’urubibe rw’umubanyi wiwe, kāshinzwe n’aba mbere.",
